    "description": "Tests AI agents on reproducing real software vulnerabilities from OSS-Fuzz projects. Each task gives a vulnerability description and an unpatched codebase; the agent must produce a proof-of-concept that triggers the pre-patch build and not the patched build. Headline score is targeted reproduction success (often pass@1).",
